  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize the 'Godori' (3 Birds) and 'Gwang' cards. They offer the fastest points.\n\nGo/Stop Calculus: If you have 3 points but your opponent is close to a 'Godori', STOP. Don't risk a 'Go' unless your hand is overwhelming.\n\nDefensive Discarding: If you have a 'Gwang' in hand but there is no match on the table, holding it prevents opponents from getting the 5 Gwang bonus. However, you risk getting stuck with it if the game ends.",
